.","interactionRules":["Presets are listed in file order with the names as written (only Custom is translated), the number of keys, and the number of members on this host each labels; the key count opens the keys of the preset.","A holder of presets.manage on a desktop layout adds, edits, reorders and deletes presets from the row menu; anyone else sees the page read-only and told which key is missing.","Someone without members.manage, or on an origin that does not serve roster administration, sees a dash instead of the member counts.","A preset holding a key this UIUX version does not know is flagged; a missing, unreadable or inconsistent presets file is reported above the table, and Start from the built-in presets writes it.","After a key edit a notice counts the members on this host who held the old keys and offers a separate step to give them the new ones."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"}],"requirements":["01a11c09-c724-7a1b-9505-3146b5b2b241","01a11c09-cd38-72c0-9af6-4598454bdcfc","01a11c09-cef3-7767-9d95-c3b89510aea3","01a11c09-cda4-748c-9e2e-5929c8447269"]},"variants":{"counts-unavailable":{"requirements":["01a11c09-cd38-72c0-9af6-4598454bdcfc"],"state":{"p-editor-members":{"visible":false},"p-editor-members-unavailable-tip":{"visible":true},"p-owner-members":{"visible":false},"p-owner-members-unavailable-tip":{"visible":true},"p-reviewer-members":{"visible":false},"p-reviewer-members-unavailable-tip":{"visible":true},"p-translator-members":{"visible":false},"p-translator-members-unavailable-tip":{"visible":true},"p-viewer-members":{"visible":false},"p-viewer-members-unavailable-tip":{"visible":true}}},"counts-unavailable-tooltip":{"state":{"p-editor-members":{"visible":false},"p-editor-members-unavailable-tip":{"visible":true},"p-owner-members":{"visible":false},"p-owner-member